(It kills J\(Q\): the diamond difference has finite rational image and) Tj T*
(the Hecke factor kills rational torsion. Thus the argument uses an) Tj T*
(actual endomorphism, not an optimal quotient's saturated cotangent.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Evaluation at P12 gives 12 independent binary cotangent columns;) Tj T*
(adding the q-coefficient column at any of the 21 rational cusps gives) Tj T*
(rank 13. All 21 matrices are retained and independently checked in) Tj T*
(Sage. Scaling the differential trivialization at P12 multiplies its) Tj T*
(12 columns by an invertible binary matrix and does not change rank.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(If an irreducible rational degree-13 divisor D had reduction P12+c,) Tj T*
(choose a diamond translate B' of the known degree-12 trace lifting P12.) Tj T*
(Then D and B'+c reduce to the same divisor, and their degree-zero) Tj T*
(difference is killed by this endomorphism. Formal immersion implies) Tj T*
(the two integral points in this residue neighbourhood are equal.) Tj T*
(But B'+c is reducible. This contradicts the irreducibility of D.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
